      "en": "He was very thirsty, and called on the LORD and said, “You have given this great deliverance by the hand of your servant; and now shall I die of thirst, and fall into the hands of the uncircumcised?”",
      "ko": "삼손이 심히 목마르므로 여호와께 부르짖어 가로되 주께서 종의 손으로 이 큰 구원을 베푸셨사오나 내가 이제 목말라 죽어서 할례 받지못한 자의 손에 빠지겠나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "df601ef4bc2bd8c4664d72e3f8b4d2159ee3a1c9b6d4ed8cf76c1bbd016450e5",
      "translation_text_hash": "0973a53fe83dec7246a460e790b6dd8d4732d8382a02887dba0635927a4f7c19",
